{"matched":54,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0466a01","n":"0466a","t":"成唯識論述記卷第七本沙門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0466b01","n":"0466b","t":"何為性惡者悔也即嫌惡所作"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0466c01","n":"0466c","t":"相通定惠故止下心故今言止"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0467a01","n":"0467a","t":"性然俗中言汝等睡在無心之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0467b01","n":"0467b","t":"分故對法亦然言通三性者隨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0467c01","n":"0467c","t":"世俗有顯揚論言夢以欲想二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0468a01","n":"0468a","t":"怱遽者怱迫遽急也意言境者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0468c01","n":"0468c","t":"二一染二不染謂此四法各染"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0469b01","n":"0469b","t":"悔眠俱得相應前二與自及與"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0469c01","n":"0469c","t":"差別彼第一言是意不共故知"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0470c01","n":"0470c","t":"第五及攝論等諸門分別如理"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0471b01","n":"0471b","t":"起耶於自十中各別起故述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0471c01","n":"0471c","t":"次應辨染以見修等後自有門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0472a01","n":"0472a","t":"熟心也彼可與俱自下第十界"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0472b01","n":"0472b","t":"亦緣上界有邪見者悔修定故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0472c01","n":"0472c","t":"見等勢力起故緣見等生故問"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0473a01","n":"0473a","t":"非所斷者於五法中唯分別攝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0473b01","n":"0473b","t":"利用任運入地非於利他亦無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0473c01","n":"0473c","t":"中極須分別如樞要說述曰緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0474b01","n":"0474b","t":"相望有無皆成失故有諸分位"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0474c01","n":"0474c","t":"色想生即無色界轉勝如蘇如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0475b01","n":"0475b","t":"中亦非即離理稍殊勝故虛幻"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0475c01","n":"0475c","t":"解起滅分位此即初也根本識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0476a01","n":"0476a","t":"多間斷故問何者為緣述曰若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0476b01","n":"0476b","t":"喻於濤波本識喻暴水述曰如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0476c01","n":"0476c","t":"之言謂第七識無漏滅定違染"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0477a01","n":"0477a","t":"答次別解五後總結之舉第二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0477b01","n":"0477b","t":"初後有心中間無心也述曰瑜"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0477c01","n":"0477c","t":"也非入中有方始起心中有有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0478a01","n":"0478a","t":"有心既舉論文次舉難曰述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0478b01","n":"0478b","t":"亦不爾有何因緣應唯起身識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0478c01","n":"0478c","t":"勢力盡故不得生彼自處及下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0479a01","n":"0479a","t":"和悅如有心定亦名為定義與"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0479b01","n":"0479b","t":"說三品修同然此受果通立坐"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0479c01","n":"0479c","t":"者先起此定也後於色界者後"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0480a01","n":"0480a","t":"十六云即簡二乘非俱脫者不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0480b01","n":"0480b","t":"等餘非根法亦滅如是等無量"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0480c01","n":"0480c","t":"經二因緣能入此定謂不思惟"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0481a01","n":"0481a","t":"心後越入此定其瑜伽第十二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0481b01","n":"0481b","t":"五會靜慮中佛呵菩薩入滅定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0481c01","n":"0481c","t":"八於一切處皆得此即據已建"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0482a01","n":"0482a","t":"便非定性不應生彼若定性者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0482b01","n":"0482b","t":"亂義此俱定障障定強故上界"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0482c01","n":"0482c","t":"理抑橫生異義却斷亦無失如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0483b01","n":"0483b","t":"引楞伽第七云謂前六地中共"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0483c01","n":"0483c","t":"第十第十三顯揚第一十地論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0484a01","n":"0484a","t":"心所時以二義故假說無心身"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0484b01","n":"0484b","t":"字中顯及與二言各顯一故述"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0484c01","n":"0484c","t":"問答分別於中有五問答大意"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0485a01","n":"0485a","t":"初質後解論主却難云如汝且"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0485b01","n":"0485b","t":"依少分相依道理為喻非盡理"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0486a01","n":"0486a","t":"體各異互不相應以共許不相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0486b01","n":"0486b","t":"為論然前言不可言一異已是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0486c01","n":"0486c","t":"八識定不定別此長行中但對"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷007a","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":115,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}